  "solution": {
    "text": "Since, osmotic pressure is a colligative property, therefore<br />Osmotic pressure <math><mo>∝</mo></math> number of solute particle in the solution.(<math> <mtext>i</mtext> </math>-factor)<br /><math><mo>∵</mo></math> Dissociation of <math> <mrow> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>AlCl</mtext></mrow> <mtext>3</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math> is maximum and of urea is minimum.<br />Hence, order of osmotic pressure will be<br /><math> <mrow>  <msub>   <mrow>    <mtext>AlCl</mtext></mrow>   <mtext>3</mtext>  </msub>  <mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>&#x003E;</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><msub>   <mrow>    <mtext>BaCl</mtext></mrow>   <mtext>2</mtext>  </msub>  <mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>&#x003E;</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>Urea</mtext></mrow></math>"
